from m6-celestic-elder.replay
# Branch m6-dialga (docs/research/postgame.md §6): the Adamant Orb in the bag
# (an item ball on Mt. Coronet 4F, given here) and the elder's unlock: Mt. Coronet 6F's on-transition puts the warp
# to SPEAR_PILLAR_DIALGA (warp 3) at the top (7, 5). The rift: "challenge Dialga?" YES, the L70 battle, caught with
# the Master Ball: VAR_SPEAR_PILLAR_DIALGA_STATE 1, FLAG_CAUGHT_DIALGA; the rift then only hums.
give item platinum:ITEM_ADAMANT_ORB 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_MT_CORONET_6F 7 6 up
until idle
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_SPEAR_PILLAR_DIALGA" 120
+0 release up
until idle 600
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_DIALGA false
+0 press up
until position 31 18 6000
+0 release up
+0 press left
until position 29 18 6000
+0 release left
until idle 60
+0 press up
+1 release up
until idle 60
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle catch platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 20000
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_DIALGA caught
advance text 20000
until idle 3000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_DIALGA true
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_SPEAR_PILLAR_DIALGA_STATE 1
+0 assert party 5 platinum:SPECIES_DIALGA
+0 assert state party[5].level 70
